OL,3,CFamily of man found dead in prison
OL,4,Ccell pay tribute as man charged with
OL,5,Cmurder
OL,7,FThe family of a man who was found dead
OL,8,Fin his prison cell have paid tribute
OL,9,Fto him as someone who will "continue
OL,10,Fto guide us."
OL,12,FRaymond McEntee, 68, was found dead at
OL,13,FHMP Altcourse, in Fazakerley,
OL,14,FLiverpool in the early hours of
OL,15,FSaturday, 18 July.
OL,17,FMartin Wainwright, 54, who was also a
OL,18,Fprisoner, was charged with his murder
OL,19,Fon Thursday, 30 July.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
