PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786034874
OL,3,CFamily of man found dead in prison
OL,4,Ccell pay tribute as man charged with
OL,5,Cmurder
OL,7,FIn a tribute, the family said:
OL,8,F"Raymond McEntee was born and lived in
OL,9,FCrossmaglen, Northern Ireland, until
OL,10,Fhis early teen's.
OL,12,F"When he went to England and the Isle
OL,13,Fof Man he worked as a plasterer. He
OL,14,Fthen married and went on to have two
OL,15,Fchildren Sharon and Shaun whom he
OL,16,Floved dearly.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786034874
OL,3,CFamily of man found dead in prison
OL,4,Ccell pay tribute as man charged with
OL,5,Cmurder
OL,7,F"As our brother you represented a
OL,8,Fconnection that did not require
OL,9,Fconstant explanation or frequent
OL,10,Freassurance. No matter how much time
OL,11,Fpassed or how far life carried us our
OL,12,Fbond always remained.
OL,14,F"We shared history, understanding and
OL,15,Ffamiliarity that could not be
OL,16,Freplicated. Although you are no longer
OL,17,Fhere that bond will never disappear
OL,18,Ffrom our lives.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786034874
OL,3,CFamily of man found dead in prison
OL,4,Ccell pay tribute as man charged with
OL,5,Cmurder
OL,7,F"We are grateful for the years we
OL,8,Fshared and the resilience we built
OL,9,Ftogether. This connection we forged
OL,10,Fthrough brotherhood and fatherhood
OL,11,Fwill continue to guide us to value
OL,12,Ffamily, trust, and lifelong
OL,13,Fcommitments. Until we meet again, your
OL,14,Floving family."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/4
